                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is the average influencer cost in India?</h3>
                                        <p>Wide range: ₹500 (nano) to ₹5 Cr+ (mega celebrity). Mid-tier (100K-500K followers) typical: ₹50K-4 lakh per campaign package.</p>
                                        <h3>Nano/micro or macro influencers — which is better?</h3>
                                        <p>For most D2C brands, nano + micro deliver 3-5x better ROI when properly matched. Macro / celebrity for brand-building + awareness.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I include paid amplification rights in creator contracts?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — UGC rights are worth 50-100% of base fee value because you can re-run in paid Meta ads.</p>
                                        <h3>What is a healthy engagement rate on Instagram?</h3>
                                        <p>3%+ on Feed, 5%+ on Reels. Below 1% often signals fake / bought followers.</p>
